{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日はままが東京にきてたので親戚とかも一緒にディズニーランドに行きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鴨！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/6994600/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう可愛すぎてやばかったです。なにあの座ってるときのフォルム！めっちゃ触りたかった......けどいつかたくさんの鳥さんに触れれることを期待して、我慢(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GW明けやからなのかまぁまぁ空いてていっぱいアトラクション乗れたーやっふぃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんと行くの楽しみになった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし胃が小さくなりました？(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/15/6994600/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指が遠近法で短くなってるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はままとそっくりな手で自分の体のパーツで唯一、好きなとこなんですよ。握手して確かめてみてください(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、レッスンいってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}